    "market_commentary": "The SSY Atlantic Capesize Index increased 1,028 points week-on-week to 9,912 points, the highest level since May. Fronthaul and trans-Atlantic earnings continued their upwards momentum, with SSY’s fronthaul earnings up $2,650/day to $41,150/day, while the round-voyage charter rates rose $6,100/day to $23,250/day.",
